	(text "NES pads (pins: 1 GND, 2 CLK, 3 LATCH, 4 DATA, 7 VCC), powered at 3.3 V\n(the pad's 4021 runs from 3 V, so DATA needs no level shifting). An SNES\npad uses the same three signals (16 bits). Pull-ups: no pad reads 'none'." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 215.00 185.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "42b1846c-441e-4713-b26d-602a458a0c71"))
