	(label "+3V3W" (at 374.65 185.42 180) (fields_autoplaced yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right bottom)) (uuid "7489e85d-6958-48fc-8cf8-3c4102ac733c"))
	(text "WiFi: ESP32-WROOM-32E (e.g. ESP-AT firmware) on its own pins, not the SD bus:\nshared, the ESP's MISO would be GPIO12, a strap the SD pull-up would hold high\n(1.8 V flash: no boot). VSPI slave: SCK IO18, MOSI IO23, MISO IO19, CS IO5;\nIO4 = handshake/interrupt to the FPGA; EN (reset) and IO0 (download mode)\ndriven by the FPGA (open drain; pull-ups, EN RC). UART1 (IO16 in, IO17 out)\nto the FPGA too; UART0 on J8 for flashing. Own AMS1117 from +5V: the module\ndraws ~500 mA when transmitting. One SPI engine in the FPGA serves SD and WiFi." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 318.00 100.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "76206cf4-d556-465e-9f44-7bc1574ea398"))
