	(text "NOR flash ROM, executed in place (a resident toolbox: no RAM spent on it).\n512 KB x 8, 3.3 V (SST39VF040; the symbol is the 5 V SST39SF040, same JEDEC\npinout). For 1 MB (SST39VF080, TSOP-40) ROM_A19 is its A19. CE# pulled up:\noff while the FPGA configures. Writes (programming) use the JEDEC command\nsequences through the same bus, with a long WE# pulse." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 110.00 225.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "bfc044f7-b186-4775-bc77-5996645278eb"))
	(text "A1 pin 22 (M10): A19 for a 1 MB part (SST39VF080); unused with 512 KB.\nJ3 needs a mini-DIN-6 footprint (e.g. CUI MD-60S): none in KiCad's library." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 110.00 240.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b2e25f77-9e18-4ece-a679-2783aecfb395"))
	(text "fpga_cpu: Spartan-3 Starter Board expansion (rough). Serial and the keyboard\nare on the board itself (DB9: RXD T13, TXD R13; PS/2: M15/M16)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.00 22.00 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ee17127e-beff-4e00-8053-cc0c1fad6f9e"))
